Subject: [PATCH 02/14] local: de-brand the navbar, sidebar and footer

- navbar: the heart no longer links to the Lemmy donation page; clicking it now offers to
  bookmark this site (share sheet where the platform has one, otherwise the URL is copied
  and the keyboard shortcut is shown)
- sidebar: show "niuma.club" instead of the admin account name
- footer: drop the docs, the code and the join-lemmy.org links, and show "niuma.club" as
  plain text

The site-specific strings live in src/shared/utils/config.ts and every edit is marked with
a LOCAL: comment, so they are easy to find when rebasing onto a newer upstream.
